### Health check
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### List the available models
GET http://localhost:8080/api/models

### Zero spread: must equal the closed-form answer 151397.835 N
POST http://localhost:8080/api/simulations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "modelId": "euler-column-buckling",
  "samples": 1000,
  "seed": 1,
  "inputs": {
    "youngsModulus":         { "type": "CONSTANT", "value": 200000000000 },
    "diameter":              { "type": "CONSTANT", "value": 0.05 },
    "length":                { "type": "CONSTANT", "value": 2.0 },
    "effectiveLengthFactor": { "type": "CONSTANT", "value": 1.0 }
  }
}

### Uncertain inputs (about 5 % modulus scatter, 1 % diameter, 0.5 % length)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/simulations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "modelId": "euler-column-buckling",
  "samples": 100000,
  "seed": 2026,
  "bins": 20,
  "inputs": {
    "youngsModulus":         { "type": "LOGNORMAL", "mean": 200000000000, "stdDev": 10000000000 },
    "diameter":              { "type": "NORMAL", "mean": 0.05, "stdDev": 0.0005 },
    "length":                { "type": "NORMAL", "mean": 2.0, "stdDev": 0.01 },
    "effectiveLengthFactor": { "type": "UNIFORM", "min": 0.9, "max": 1.1 }
  }
}

### Deliberately invalid: samples below the minimum of 100 (expect HTTP 400 with an "errors" map)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/simulations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "modelId": "euler-column-buckling",
  "samples": 5,
  "inputs": {
    "youngsModulus":         { "type": "CONSTANT", "value": 200000000000 },
    "diameter":              { "type": "CONSTANT", "value": 0.05 },
    "length":                { "type": "CONSTANT", "value": 2.0 },
    "effectiveLengthFactor": { "type": "CONSTANT", "value": 1.0 }
  }
}

### Phase 2 - queue an asynchronous job (expect 202 and a Location header; copy the id)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "modelId": "euler-column-buckling",
  "samples": 100000,
  "seed": 2026,
  "inputs": {
    "youngsModulus":         { "type": "LOGNORMAL", "mean": 200000000000, "stdDev": 10000000000 },
    "diameter":              { "type": "NORMAL", "mean": 0.05, "stdDev": 0.0005 },
    "length":                { "type": "NORMAL", "mean": 2.0, "stdDev": 0.01 },
    "effectiveLengthFactor": { "type": "UNIFORM", "min": 0.9, "max": 1.1 }
  }
}

### Poll one job (replace JOB_ID with the id returned above)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/jobs/JOB_ID

### List jobs: newest first, 5 per page
GET http://localhost:8080/api/jobs?page=0&size=5

### List only finished jobs
GET http://localhost:8080/api/jobs?status=DONE

### Cantilever tip deflection (P = 1 kN, L = 1 m, steel, d = 50 mm: deterministic value 5.4325 mm)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "modelId": "cantilever-tip-deflection",
  "samples": 50000,
  "seed": 7,
  "inputs": {
    "load":          { "type": "NORMAL", "mean": 1000, "stdDev": 100 },
    "length":        { "type": "NORMAL", "mean": 1.0, "stdDev": 0.005 },
    "youngsModulus": { "type": "LOGNORMAL", "mean": 200000000000, "stdDev": 10000000000 },
    "diameter":      { "type": "NORMAL", "mean": 0.05, "stdDev": 0.0005 }
  }
}

### Spring-mass natural frequency (k = 1000 N/m, m = 1 kg: deterministic value 5.0329 Hz)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "modelId": "spring-mass-natural-frequency",
  "samples": 50000,
  "seed": 7,
  "inputs": {
    "stiffness": { "type": "NORMAL", "mean": 1000, "stdDev": 50 },
    "mass":      { "type": "UNIFORM", "min": 0.95, "max": 1.05 }
  }
}
